  "content": "<p>Venture Global LNG is a long-term, low-cost provider of American-produced liquefied natural gas (LNG) sourced from resource-rich North American natural gas basins. The company is developing a series of LNG export terminals in Louisiana, including the Calcasieu Pass, Plaquemines LNG, and CP2 LNG facilities. By utilizing a highly efficient, mid-scale liquefaction technology, Venture Global aims to provide clean and reliable energy to global markets while maintaining a commitment to environmental sustainability and operational excellence in the energy infrastructure sector.</p>\n",
  "tabs": [
    {
      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Michael%20Sabel\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Michael Sabel</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2013</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Executive Co-Chairman and Chief Executive Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Michael Sabel is the Executive Co-Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of Venture Global LNG. He has been a key figure in the company's development and strategic direction since its inception.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Robert%20Pender\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Robert Pender</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2013</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Executive Co-Chairman</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Robert Pender is the Executive Co-Chairman of Venture Global LNG. He co-founded the company and previously served as Co-CEO alongside Michael Sabel.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Jonathan%20Thier\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Jonathan Thier</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Financial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Jonathan Thier serves as the Chief Financial Officer of Venture Global LNG, overseeing the company's financial operations and capital markets activities.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Brian%20Cothran\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Brian Cothran</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Operating Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Brian Cothran is the Chief Operating Officer of Venture Global LNG. He joined the company with extensive experience in the energy and industrial sectors, including roles at GE and Baker Hughes.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Tom%20Earl\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Tom Earl</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2017</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Commercial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Tom Earl is the Chief Commercial Officer of Venture Global LNG, responsible for the company's commercial strategy and LNG marketing.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Michael%20Sabel\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Michael Sabel</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2013</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Executive Co-Chairman</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Executive Co-Chairman and CEO of Venture Global LNG.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Robert%20Pender\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Robert Pender</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2013</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Executive Co-Chairman</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Executive Co-Chairman and Co-Founder of Venture Global LNG.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sources</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://venturegloballng.com/about/leadership/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Venture Global LNG Official Leadership Page</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-11-20)</span></li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1999406/000119312524274384/d812402ds1.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">SEC Form S-1 Registration Statement for Venture Global LNG, Inc.</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-11-20)</span></li></ul>"
